# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# LLM Configuration
# Perfil local de referencia — Railway se sincroniza desde aquí (sync-railway-production-vars.sh)
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# (Required) OpenAI API key for core agent brain (classification + planning + tool calling)
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# (Optional, default: gpt-5.2) OpenAI model for chart/table MCP tool loop only
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-5.2

# (Optional, default: gpt-4.1-mini) OpenAI model for non-visual tool loops
OPENAI_MODEL_FAST=gpt-4.1-mini

# (Optional) Quality model for quality mode
OPENAI_MODEL_QUALITY=

# (Optional, default: 0.6) Temperature for OpenAI responses (0.0-1.0)
OPENAI_TEMPERATURE=0.2

# (Optional, default: 2048) Max completion tokens for regular OpenAI calls
OPENAI_MAX_COMPLETION_TOKENS=2048

# (Optional, default: 1536) Max completion tokens for structured JSON calls
OPENAI_STRUCTURED_MAX_COMPLETION_TOKENS=1536

# ---- Cartolas / OCR (calidad alta, costo controlado) ----
# Estrategia: mini en la primera pasada; modelo full solo si el OCR queda incompleto.

# OCR primario (imágenes, PDF escaneado, fallback local débil)
TRANSACTIONS_VISION_MODEL=gpt-4.1-mini

# Reintento OCR — solo cuando la pasada mini queda sparse/incompleta
TRANSACTIONS_VISION_FALLBACK_MODEL=gpt-4.1

# Perfil del documento: banco, columnas cargo/abono, convención de signos
TRANSACTIONS_PROFILE_MODEL=gpt-4.1-mini

# Normaliza tablas → movimientos con direction income/expense
TRANSACTIONS_RECONCILE_MODEL=gpt-4.1-mini

# Clasificación visual abono/egreso en capturas de app (multimodal, mira color/signo/icono)
TRANSACTIONS_DIRECTION_VISION_MODEL=gpt-4.1
# Umbral mínimo de confianza para aplicar la clasificación visual (0-1)
TRANSACTIONS_DIRECTION_VISION_MIN_CONFIDENCE=0.62

# Tipo de antecedente (cartola vs seguro vs inversión) en fotos
TRANSACTIONS_EVIDENCE_KIND_MODEL=gpt-4.1-mini

# high = mejor lectura de montos pequeños (sin cambiar de modelo)
TRANSACTIONS_VISION_DETAIL=high

# Resumen y chat del modal de transacciones (no afectan OCR)
TRANSACTIONS_SUMMARY_MODEL=gpt-4.1-mini
TRANSACTIONS_CHAT_MODEL=gpt-4.1-mini

# (Optional, default: 2048) Max completion tokens for tool-planning loop
OPENAI_PLAN_MAX_COMPLETION_TOKENS=2048

# (Required) Anthropic API key for Claude frontend report formatting
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# (Optional, default: claude-sonnet-4-6) Claude for non-core flows (reports, etc.)
# Options: claude-opus-4-6, claude-sonnet-4-6, claude-haiku-4-5
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6

# (Required for core agent) Always Haiku — classify + format responses (never Sonnet)
ANTHROPIC_MODEL_FAST=claude-haiku-4-5

# (Optional) Quality Claude model for quality mode
ANTHROPIC_MODEL_QUALITY=

# (Optional, default: 0.6) Temperature for LLM responses (0.0-1.0)
# Lower = more deterministic, Higher = more creative
ANTHROPIC_TEMPERATURE=0.3

# (Optional, default: 2048) Max output tokens for Claude formatter calls
ANTHROPIC_MAX_TOKENS=2048

# (Optional, default: true in dev) Budget chat ReAct loop
BUDGET_CHAT_REACT_ENABLED=true

# (Optional, default: balanced) LLM budget/latency policy
# balanced = smart routing/tokens, fast = max savings/speed, quality = max depth
AGENT_LLM_BUDGET_MODE=balanced

# (Optional, default: false) Skip expensive response beautification phase for lower latency
AGENT_FAST_FORMAT=false

# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Frontend Agent UX (Latency Controls)
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# (Optional, default: 65000) Request timeout in ms for chat agent calls
NEXT_PUBLIC_AGENT_TIMEOUT_MS=65000

# (Optional, default: true) Retry once when timeout occurs (higher reliability, higher latency)
NEXT_PUBLIC_AGENT_RETRY_TIMEOUT=true

# (Optional, default: true) Retry once on 5xx responses (higher reliability, higher latency)
NEXT_PUBLIC_AGENT_RETRY_5XX=true

# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Server Configuration
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# (Optional, default: 3000) HTTP server port
PORT=3000

# (Optional, default: development) Environment mode
# Options: development, production, test
NODE_ENV=development

# (Optional, default: http://localhost:3000) Frontend origin for CORS
WEB_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000

# (Optional, dev) Comma-separated extra browser origins (e.g. http://192.168.1.42:3000)
# Auto-detected LAN IPs are also allowed in development.
DEV_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=

# (Optional, dev) Loopback URL for Next.js /backend rewrites and agent stream proxy
# Leave empty — defaults to http://127.0.0.1:3001 on the dev machine.
INTERNAL_API_ORIGIN=

# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Session & Storage Configuration
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# (Optional, default: 7) Session TTL in days
SESSION_TTL_DAYS=7

# (Required in production, min 32 chars) Secret used to HMAC-hash session tokens at rest
# Generate a strong random token: $(openssl rand -base64 32)
# SECURITY: Must be different in each environment (dev, staging, production)
SESSION_TOKEN_SECRET=your-super-secret-token-at-least-32-chars-long-change-in-prod

# (Optional, default: session) Cookie name
SESSION_COOKIE_NAME=session

# (Optional, default: lax) Cookie SameSite policy: lax | strict | none
SESSION_COOKIE_SAME_SITE=lax

# (Optional) Credenciales de cuenta ADMIN de bootstrap.
# En desarrollo, si lo dejas vacío, se usa admin@financieramente.local / Financieramente123!
BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN_EMAIL=
BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN_PASSWORD=
BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN_NAME=Administrador
ENABLE_BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN_LOGIN=false

# (Optional, default: enabled in development) Pre-create approved QA accounts on API startup
# qa-desk-local@financieramente.invalid / qa-mobile-local@financieramente.invalid
# Password for both: Financieramente123!
# Intake is pre-filled so login goes straight to /agent (no questionnaire).
ENABLE_DEV_TEST_USERS=true

# Approval workflow (new users require manual authorization)
RESEND_API_KEY=
APPROVAL_ADMIN_EMAIL=sasha.oyanadel@ug.uchile.cl
APPROVAL_LINK_SECRET=replace-with-a-random-secret-min-32-chars
APPROVAL_LINK_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3001
APPROVAL_LINK_TTL_HOURS=24
APPROVAL_EMAIL_FROM=Financieramente <onboarding@financieramente.app>
# Optional support contact shown to rejected users in email copy
APPROVAL_SUPPORT_EMAIL=sasha.oyanadel@ug.uchile.cl

# (Optional) Cookie domain (set only when needed)
# SESSION_COOKIE_DOMAIN=.example.com

# (Optional, default: 30) Session rotation interval in minutes
SESSION_ROTATE_INTERVAL_MINUTES=30

# (Optional, default: ./data) Directory for storing user data and profiles
DATA_DIR=./data

# (Optional) Postgres DSN for persistent storage (required in production)
# Example:
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/financial_agent
DATABASE_URL=

# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Development Features (Disable in Production)
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# (Optional, default: false) Enable dev-only data injection endpoints
# SECURITY: Keep false in production
ENABLE_DEV_INJECTION=false

# (Optional, default: change-me) Admin token for dev endpoints
# Required only if ENABLE_DEV_INJECTION=true
DEV_ADMIN_TOKEN=change-me

# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Financial Context Fabric (optional — default off in production)
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# Financial Context Fabric (optional — default ON in development, OFF in production)
# En local (NODE_ENV=development) el código activa MCP/packs aunque no declares estas vars.
# Railway prod debe setearlas explícitamente para igualar el comportamiento local.
FINANCIAL_CONTEXT_MCP_ENABLED=true
FINANCIAL_CONTEXT_SHADOW_MODE=false
CORE_CONTEXT_PACK_ENABLED=true
BUDGET_CONTEXT_PACK_ENABLED=true
TRANSACTIONS_CONTEXT_PUBLISH_ENABLED=true
DIAGNOSTIC_CONTEXT_PACK_ENABLED=true
CONTEXT_CONSISTENCY_ENABLED=true
CONTEXT_CONFLICT_UI_ENABLED=true

# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Logging Configuration
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# (Optional, default: info) Log level
# Options: trace, debug, info, warn, error, fatal
LOG_LEVEL=info
